#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:60
#: e3684eddcc2c43ebb576c4fb3ee5de9d
msgid "**Upload your images** – drag GeoTIFF files into the Upload area (or click to browse). If no mosaic is selected in the table, a new mosaic is created automatically and the files are uploaded into it. To upload into an existing mosaic, select it in the list first. You can also create an empty mosaic in advance with **\"+ Create mosaic\"**."
